Z||000005||Alex4mula||04-18-2000||01:37 PM||||Gee...Good to know. I plan to install mines with the new 3.4 out and then try to stuck the whole thing in. Or at least with the front one installed (close to firewall). Hope it is posible...||||reg||1
Z||000006||Pretender||04-18-2000||02:47 PM||||I would imagine that if you were pulling the heads and intake it would be possible to bolt the headders on and install the heads. I think that would work. When i upgrade my heades i guess i'll find out. Again i think it all depends on which headders you use. I used the focoa headders. The Sprint manifolds  look like they would go in smoother.||||reg||1
