Z||000008||Patrick||04-19-2000||07:13 PM||||<BR>Geez, I never had any problems like that over the last 25 years putting headers on my Camaro, Nova, Chevelle, or full size Chev. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Pretender, my favourite part of the story was your comment about selling the car if you broke a bolt off in the head. Sounds like something I'd do too! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
